  "instructions": [
    "Wrap a small amount of Japanese short-grain rice onto a flat surface, leaving room to shape into a triangle.",
    "Place a small piece of extra-firm tofu in the center of the rice.",
    "Gently fold the rice over the tofu to form a triangle, applying gentle pressure to seal the onigiri.",
    "Repeat with the remaining ingredients to create 6-8 onigiri.",
    "Heat a small amount of sesame oil in a pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the grated ginger and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the onion and green chili pepper and cook until softened, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add the cooked onigiri to the pan and cook for 2-3 minutes on each side, until lightly browned.",
    "Garnish with black sesame seeds and serve warm."
  ],
